/div>
<div class="shv-summary"><a class="shv-prooflink" href="#shv-{{ section.id }}-reviews"><span class="shv-proof-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Read women’s experiences <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="shv-product-name">Daily Slim</p><h1 id="shv-{{ section.id }}-title">A little more ease.<br><span class="shv-title-accent">Every day.</span></h1><p class="shv-lead">When your usual routine feels different, support your digestion, appetite and metabolism with one thoughtful daily formula.*</p><ul class="shv-benefits"><li>Digestive comfort*</li><li>Appetite support*</li><li>Metabolic support*</li></ul><div class="shv-price-row"><strong class="shv-price" data-current-price>{{ selected.price | money }}</strong><s class="shv-compare" data-compare-price {% unless selected.compare_at_price > selected.price %}hidden{% endunless %}>{{ selected.compare_at_price | money }}</s><span class="shv-saving" data-saving {% unless selected.compare_at_price > selected.price %}hidden{% endunless %}>Save {{ selected.compare_at_price | minus: selected.price | money }}</span></div><p class="shv-offer-caption" data-unit-price>{{ selected.price | divided_by: selected_bottles | money }} per bottle · One-time purchase</p>
<form class="shv-purchase" data-product-form method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><fieldset><legend>Choose your supply</legend><div class="shv-options">{% for variant in product.variants %}
{% assign bottles = variant.title | split: ' ' | first | plus: 0 %}
{% if bottles == 1 or bottles == 3 or bottles == 5 %}
<label class="shv-option"><input data-variant-radio type="radio" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}" {% if variant.id == selected.id %}checked{% endif %} {% unless variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}><span><span class="shv-option-title">{{ variant.title | escape }}{% if bottles == 3 %}<span class="shv-option-badge">90-day routine</span>{% endif %}</span><span class="shv-option-detail">{{ bottles | times: 30 }}-day supply · {{ variant.price | divided_by: bottles | money }} per bottle{% unless variant.available %} · Sold out{% endunless %}</span></span><span class="shv-option-price">{{ variant.price | money }}<small>one-time total</small></span></label>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></fieldset><p class="shv-purchase-type"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> One-time purchase. No automatic refills.</p><button class="shv-btn shv-submit" type="submit" data-add {% unless selected.available %}disabled{% endunless %}><span data-add-label>Add to bag</span><span><span data-current-price>{{ selected.price | money }}</span> &nbsp; →</span></button><div class="shv-trust"><span>Free US shipping</span><a href="https://shevelia.co/policies/refund-policy">30-day unopened returns</a></div><p class="shv-form-status" data-form-status role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></p></form>
