<section class="shv-section shv-wrap shv-editorial"><div class="shv-editorial-image"><img src="{{ 'life-reflection.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="An illustrative moment in a midlife woman’s day" loading="lazy" width="700" height="680"><div class="shv-editorial-tag">For the days your jeans feel different.</div></div><div class="shv-editorial-copy"><span class="shv-eyebrow">You know your body</span><h2>Same routine.<br>A different feeling.</h2><p>The meals, the walks, the effort. You know your routine. If midlife has brought new digestive discomfort or a different appetite, a little support can belong alongside it.</p><div class="shv-reasons"><div class="shv-reason"><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with everyday comfort</h3><p>A formula that brings gut, appetite and metabolic support together.*</p></div></div><div class="shv-reason"><span>02</span><div><h3>Know what you’re taking</h3><p>Seven active ingredients with their amounts clearly shown. No guessing games.</p></div></div><div class="shv-reason"><span>03</span><div><h3>Keep your routine yours</h3><p>Two capsules with a meal. A one-time purchase, with no automatic refill.</p></div></div></div><a class="shv-textlink" href="#shv-{{ section.id }}-formula">Get to know your formula ↗</a></div></section>
