<section id="shv-{{ section.id }}-formula" class="shv-section shv-ingredients"><div class="shv-wrap"><div class="shv-section-intro"><div><span class="shv-eyebrow">What goes in matters</span><h2>Seven ingredients.<br>Nothing left to guess.</h2></div><p>Know the ingredients. See the amounts. Make a choice that feels informed.</p></div><div class="shv-ingredient-grid"><article class="shv-ingredient"><img src="{{ 'ingredient-probiotic.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Probiotic blend" loading="lazy" width="440" height="326"><h3>Probiotic blend</h3><span class="shv-dose">10 billion CFU · 100 mg</span><p>For daily digestive support.*</p></article><article class="shv-ingredient"><img src="{{ 'ingredient-berberine.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Berberine HCl" loading="lazy" width="440" height="326"><h3>Berberine HCl</h3><span class="shv-dose">200 mg</span><p>Part of the appetite and metabolism formula.*</p></article><article class="shv-ingredient"><img src="{{ 'ingredient-ashwagandha.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="KSM-66 ashwagandha" loading="lazy" width="440" height="326"><h3>KSM-66 ashwagandha</h3><span class="shv-dose">200 mg</span><p>For support through everyday stress.*</p></article><article class="shv-ingredient"><img src="{{ 'ingredient-green-tea.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Green tea extract" loading="lazy" width="440" height="326"><h3>Green tea extract</h3><span class="shv-dose">150 mg</span><p>A botanical in the metabolic-support blend.*</p></article></div><div class="shv-full-formula"><div><h3>The complete formula</h3><p class="shv-label-note">Amounts per two-capsule serving. 30 servings per bottle. The full label is here for you to inspect.</p><button class="shv-btn shv-label-btn" data-zoom="{{ 'ds-facts.webp' | asset_url }}" data-zoom-alt="Daily Slim Supplement Facts" type="button">Read the Supplement Facts <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="shv-label-note" style="margin-top:20px">Contains milk and soy. Contains green tea extract; take with food. Not for anyone under 18, pregnant or nursing. Ask a healthcare professional before use, especially with blood sugar, blood pressure or blood-thinning medication. Read all warnings on your bottle.</p></div><div class="shv-dose-list"><div><span>Chromium</span><strong>200 mcg</strong></div><div><span>Berberine HCl</span><strong>200 mg</strong></div><div><span>Green tea extract</span><strong>150 mg</strong></div><div><span>KSM-66 ashwagandha</span><strong>200 mg</strong></div><div><span>Probiotic blend</span><strong>100 mg / 10B CFU</strong></div><div><span>Black cohosh</span><strong>40 mg</strong></div><div><span>Black pepper extract</span><strong>5 mg</strong></div></div></div><p class="shv-disclosure">Ingredient information describes the formula; it is not a claim that this finished product has been clinically tested. Individual results vary.</p></div></section>
<section class="shv-section shv-wrap"><div class="shv-section-intro"><div><span class="shv-eyebrow">Room for a real routine</span><h2>Consistency, without<br>the countdown.</h2></div><p>The product directions recommend 8–12 weeks of daily use. Give your routine context, without expecting an overnight change.</p></div><div class="shv-timeline"><article><span class="shv-eyebrow">01 / Before you begin</span><h3>Start informed.</h3><p>Read the label, check ingredient sensitivities, and discuss suitability with your healthcare professional.</p></article><article><span class="shv-eyebrow">02 / Every day</span><h3>Keep it simple.</h3><p>Take two capsules with a meal. Choose a moment you can repeat and notice how you feel over time.</p></article><article><span class="shv-eyebrow">03 / Your check-in</span><h3>Reflect, don’t rush.</h3><p>Review your experience over 8–12 weeks. Results differ, and your own wellbeing comes before any schedule.</p></article></div></section>
