<section class="shv-wrap"><div class="shv-routine"><div><span class="shv-eyebrow">A daily moment, just for you</span><h2>Two capsules.<br>One less thing<br>to overthink.</h2><p class="shv-muted">With a meal, at a time that works for you. Your selected supply is a one-time purchase, so you stay in control of the next step.</p><a class="shv-btn" href="#shv-{{ section.id }}-shop">Choose your supply <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><img src="{{ 'ds-life.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Illustrative Daily Slim daily routine" loading="lazy" width="650" height="600"></div></section>
<section class="shv-section shv-wrap shv-faq"><div><span class="shv-eyebrow">A little clarity</span><h2>Good questions.<br>Clear answers.</h2><p class="shv-muted">Still have something on your mind?</p><a class="shv-textlink" href="https://shevelia.co/pages/contact">Talk to Shevelia ↗</a></div><div><details><summary>How do I take it?</summary><p>Take two capsules together once daily with a meal, following the directions on your bottle. Each bottle contains 60 vegetarian capsules: a 30-day supply.</p></details><details><summary>When should I assess my routine?</summary><p>The product directions recommend consistent use over 8–12 weeks. Individual experiences vary. A supply length is not a promise of results; speak with a qualified healthcare professional if symptoms persist or you have concerns.</p></details><details><summary>Is Daily Slim a weight-loss treatment?</summary><p>No. Daily Slim is a dietary supplement for digestive, appetite and metabolic support. It does not replace balanced meals, movement or medical care, and it does not guarantee weight loss.</p></details><details><summary>Who should check before using it?</summary><p>Contains milk and soy. Contains green tea extract; take with food. Not for anyone under 18, pregnant or nursing. Ask a healthcare professional before use, especially with blood sugar, blood pressure or blood-thinning medication. Read all warnings on your bottle.</p></details><details><summary>Will I be enrolled in a subscription?</summary><p>No. Every offer on this page is a one-time purchase. You receive the supply you select, with no automatic refill or recurring charge.</p></details><details><summary>What are the shipping and return terms?</summary><p>Free US shipping is offered by the store. Unopened, sealed bottles in their original box may be returned within 30 days of confirmed delivery after contacting support. Return postage is paid by the customer. Opened bottles are not eligible and there is no satisfaction guarantee. <a href="https://shevelia.co/policies/refund-policy">Read the full return policy</a>.</p></details><details><summary>How do the bundles work?</summary><p>Select 1, 3 or 5 bottles. The total shown is the price for the whole supply. Three bottles cover 90 days and five cover 150 days at the label’s recommended serving. Your selected offer and image stay together when you add it to your bag.</p></details></div></section>
